# Docker / OCI proxy: the docker daemon pulls through Waystation in mirror mode (registry-mirrors), by repository
# prefix, by upstream alias and through a dedicated port connector (docker-hub on 5001, docker-hosted on 5002);
# skopeo inspects, lists tags and copies (tests/clients/README.md;
# Documents/Operations/clients/docker.md). Tiny images only, pinned to linux/amd64 so replay works on any host.
# Hosted (hosted.sh): buildx multi-platform push, crane, skopeo, oras, cosign; then the OCI conformance suite in its
# own client container (conformance.sh). Hosted steps reach no upstream.

# Docker Hub (registry, token service, both blob CDNs) and GHCR (registry, blob CDN).
HOSTS="registry-1.docker.io auth.docker.io production.cloudflare.docker.com production.cloudfront.docker.com ghcr.io pkg-containers.githubusercontent.com"
# docker:dind with curl, skopeo, crane, oras and cosign added (compose.harness.yaml); setup.sh starts dockerd.
# containerd (ctr with hosts.toml, containerd.sh) runs in the docker client too. Then podman (client-podman, podman.sh)
# and the distribution-spec conformance suite (client-conformance) against the hosted repository.
CLIENT="docker podman conformance"
NEEDS_STACK=1
# hello-world (Docker Hub, a few KB) and busybox (GHCR, ~2 MB layer).
FIXTURE_BUDGET_KB=4096
